                  "revisionId": 2676559,
                  "section": "Notes",
                  "excerpt": "Because there is a delay between when an enemy is first affected by a Lull field and when it falls asleep and the sleep timer starts decreasing, enemies slept by a re-triggered field will wake up later than enemies slept by the original field."
                }
              },
